        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "l5K7fQ",
          "name": "Behavior rules",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "NO CHANGES: review disabled with “No draft changes”. INVALID: preserve edits; link errors to paths; block save and publish. PERMISSION: server-enforced edit/publish rights; read-only users may inspect/export. RE-ENTRY: saved draft shows author/time; unsaved edits are never claimed as saved. No version history, historical comparison, or historical restore is included. PUBLISH SUCCESS: return to the existing Definition editor with published values, update the status footer, and show the shared “Definition published” success toast. No standalone success screen.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Lj2ZO",
          "name": "Implementation boundary",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Editable data: all ToolSpec properties and FieldSpec attributes, within registered implementation constraints. Visible but guarded: toolId, app, existing route identity, input kind/engine/channels, setting keys/types and runner enum values. A deployed compatibility manifest must explicitly allow structural changes; unsupported changes produce path errors. Execution hosts come from run filenames; custom workspaces and algorithms still require code. Password defaults must remain empty; secrets are never persisted in revisions.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "IxdvU",
          "name": "Publish semantics",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Integration: Catalog & SEO, Content document, icons and availability keep their existing controls and persistence. New definition drafts own runtime properties; catalog/content paths in resolved JSON link to their existing editors rather than competing overrides. Apply existing content overrides after the active runtime definition. Publish runtime revisions atomically; revalidate against the deployed runner and retain the previous revision on failure.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
