          "name": "Canonical draft fixture · coherent end-to-end sample",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The example draft changes exactly five paths: name = “JSON Formatter & Validator”; input.maxLength = 1,000,000; trigger.debounceMs = 250; settings.fields.indentation.default = “4”; labels.ready = “Your formatted JSON is ready.” JSON recovery, review and preview use this fixture. Source defaults remain 2,000,000 characters / 120 ms / “2” / “Formatted JSON is ready.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Geist",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
