      "name": "Developer handoff · Full definition JSON / future feature",
      "width": 1366,
      "fill": "$surface",
      "stroke": "$border-strong",
      "strokeWidth": {
        "top": 1
      },
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "padding": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "L0Df6",
          "name": "Handoff heading",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "content": "Developer handoff · Full definition JSON / future feature",
          "fontFamily": "$font-heading",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "TXjhf",
          "name": "Whole definition discovery",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "os7wT",
              "name": "Whole definition discovery label",
              "fill": "$fg-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 220,
              "content": "Whole definition discovery",
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "IO6V3",
              "name": "Whole definition discovery details",
              "fill": "$fg-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Resolved definition mode is read-only: complete code defaults + saved draft overrides, with provenance per path, search, expand/collapse and Copy path. Show every declared key: toolId, app, slug, category, keywords, name, description, input, settings, trigger, capabilities, layout, optionsPanel, workbenchMark, labels, content. Absent optional keys are listed as “not set”, never invented defaults. Edit an unlocked path switches to Draft overrides and focuses that path.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "JhOUF",
          "name": "Safe edit boundary",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "PKATl",
              "name": "Safe edit boundary label",
              "fill": "$fg-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 220,
              "content": "Safe edit boundary",
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "rU2EP",
              "name": "Safe edit boundary details",
              "fill": "$fg-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Draft mode edits a JSON object only, not a whole TypeScript module. Reject TS syntax, unknown fields and functions; never eval or import executable code. Protect identity and runtime contracts server-side: toolId/app/route slug, input discriminants/channels/engine, setting keys/kinds/choice values and runner contract. Folder/host are code-owned metadata, not editable ToolSpec fields. Labels, copy, approved settings defaults and safe behavior/layout values remain editable.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "GeWSL",
          "name": "Import / export / reset",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "T8GfE",
              "name": "Import / export / reset label",
              "fill": "$fg-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 220,
              "content": "Import / export / reset",
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DpTxM",
              "name": "Import / export / reset details",
              "fill": "$fg-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Import accepts .json into a temporary buffer, then parses, validates paths and previews a diff before replacing the draft buffer. Never imports into live config. Export offers Draft overrides or Complete resolved JSON; the latter is explicitly read-only reference, not an override import. Reset requires confirmation and clears draft overrides only; Undo restores them. Live r12 is untouched.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "hNBSK",
          "name": "Error → recovery → save",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "jeWcK",
              "name": "Error → recovery → save label",
              "fill": "$fg-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 220,
              "content": "Error → recovery → save",
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "pd4vx",
              "name": "Error → recovery → save details",
              "fill": "$fg-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Shown state follows a typed trailing comma. Fix trailing comma removes only that token, retains the buffer, and reruns validation; Undo restores the prior buffer. Jump from an error to its line/path. Once parsing succeeds, show all schema errors, e.g. /settings/fields/indentation/default: expected one of “2”, “4”, “tab”. No silent coercion. Invalid JSON blocks Save and Publish; export the buffer for recovery.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "AtARg",
          "name": "Successful handoff",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "LFgkS",
              "name": "Successful handoff label",
              "fill": "$fg-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 220,
              "content": "Successful handoff",
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "cypqr",
              "name": "Successful handoff details",
              "fill": "$fg-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "After valid JSON: “Valid · unsaved changes”, Save draft enabled, Review changes replaces the disabled publish action. Saving records r14, then Review changes shows code/previous draft diff and the shared publish confirmation. Conflicts offer Reload latest / Export my edits; preserve local input. Switching modes never loses the current buffer.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "wckWo",
          "name": "Viewport & QA",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "hvB2E",
              "name": "Viewport & QA label",
              "fill": "$fg-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 220,
              "content": "Viewport & QA",
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "o3QHLV",
              "name": "Viewport & QA details",
              "fill": "$fg-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Baseline 1366 × 768; initial viewport ends at the definition footer. Both editors also inspected at 1280 × 720 with no detected clipping. Documentation below is not application UI. Checklist: direct editing, selected tabs, alignment, readable tokens, validation/recovery, save/export handoff. Independent ui_validator and end_user_validator runs are pending: agent invocation is unavailable in this tool session.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
