                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 24,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "rAyrN",
                      "name": "Article paragraph",
                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Set the due date and payment method with your client before taking on the project. Then repeat those terms on the invoice. A specific date is clearer than “payment due soon.” If you charge deposits or late fees, only include terms you have agreed on and that comply with applicable rules.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "d57H5",
                      "name": "3. Send it to the right person",
                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "3. Send it to the right person",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 24,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "uziBw",
                      "name": "Article paragraph",
                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Ask who handles billing and whether they need a purchase order or other reference. Send a PDF or a secure invoice link, and use a subject line with the invoice number. Keep a copy so you can check the amount, due date, and payment status later.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wo6rP",
                      "name": "Common mistakes to avoid",
                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Common mistakes to avoid",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 24,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "RJWHh",
                      "name": "Article paragraph",
                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Do not leave out the currency, send an unexplained total, or assume your project contact handles payments. Check your calculations and payment details before sending. Tax and invoice requirements vary by location; check the rules that apply to your business.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "QkTkf",
                      "name": "Frequently asked questions",
                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Frequently asked questions",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 24,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Ch10p",
                      "name": "Article paragraph",
                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Can I invoice without accounting software?\nYes. A document template or invoice generator can help you create a clear invoice. You still need to keep accurate records.\n\nWhat if the payment is late?\nSend a polite reminder with the invoice attached. Restate the amount and due date, and ask whether anything is blocking payment.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "OFnCX",
                      "name": "Before you hit send",
                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Before you hit send",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 24,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Mq6gj",
                      "name": "Article paragraph",
                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Check the details, confirm the total, and make the next step obvious. A few minutes of care can spare both you and your client a long email exchange. Save your invoice as a reusable starting point for your next project.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
