                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Behavior contract",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ZGWoP",
                  "name": "Handoff rules",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• / at the caret opens the picker. Human-readable names and descriptions; slugs are search aliases only.\n• Selecting inserts an atomic mention into the sentence—not an attachment row. Keep typing before or after it.\n• Mentions wrap with text. Click to inspect/remove. Backspace selects, then deletes; Undo restores.\n• Enter selects in picker, sends when closed. Shift+Enter = newline; Escape closes.\n• One agent + one action per turn. Replacing a type updates its mention; no duplicates.\n• Send stores instruction versions and inline positions. Failed sends preserve text and mentions.\n• Sent messages retain inline names; click for read-only instructions. Follow-ups start without mentions.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
