                                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "You have finished the work. Now make it easy for your client to pay you. A clear freelance invoice explains what you delivered, what it costs, and when payment is due. You do not need a complicated system—just the right details and a consistent process.",
