                  "content": "A pocket with a thumb notch, and something already tucked in it. Everyday carry — the useful thing you keep on you rather than a workshop you visit. Warm and human, and the notch makes the silhouette instantly recognisable.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 12.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
