                      "name": "Research takeaway",
                      "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A directional red signature unifies a platform full of commands. Its press kit distinguishes logo, wordmark and app icon. Takeaway: own a visual gesture, not a toolbox.",
