                      "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Brand guidelines emphasize an instantly recognizable universal signature. Takeaway: retain one core silhouette across applications; do not imitate its box metaphor.",
