                      "id": "wkGc1",
                      "name": "Idea",
                      "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A single frame whose corners travel from a hard square to a full quarter-circle as you go round it. One form holding both extremes at once — versatile without being shapeless. Nothing is repeated, so it never reads as a grid of tools.",
